Report}}{Q:1 - Emacs configuration audit: Modernisation Report}}\label{q1---emacs-configuration-audit-modernisation-report}

\hyperref[toc]{\^{}}

\begin{itemize}
\tightlist
\item
  \href{https://github.com/hute37/emacs-site/blob/master/notes/howtos/EMACS-Q1-Configuration-Audit.md}{EMACS-Q1-Configuration-Audit.md}
