includes rollback instructions, and respects platform guards and naming
conventions.

\subsection{1. Fix Python Notebook Eglot Hook Syntax (Priority:
High)}\label{1-fix-python-notebook-eglot-hook-syntax-priority-high}

\begin{itemize}
\tightlist
\item
  Target Org Heading: \texttt{*\ Lang\ ::\ Python/lsp}
\item
  Action: Replaces broken hook code.
\end{itemize}

\begin{Shaded}
\begin{Highlighting}[]
\NormalTok{;; Replaces the malformed python{-}ts{-}mode hook for notebooks}
\NormalTok{(add{-}hook \textquotesingle{}python{-}ts{-}mode{-}hook}
\NormalTok{          (lambda ()}
\NormalTok{            (when (and buffer{-}file{-}name}
