  and attempts to switch clients later. The notebook hook also contains
  the malformed \texttt{when} condition described above.
\item
  Recommendation: Select the backend once, after directory-local
  variables have been processed. Use the directory-local variable as an
  explicit override and the notebook path plus \texttt{\#\ \%\%} markers
  as automatic detection.
\item
