\subsubsection{DUP-08: Python LSP-client selection has an ordering
race}\label{dup-08-python-lsp-client-selection-has-an-ordering-race}

\begin{itemize}
\tightlist
\item
  Location: org headings “Lang R.ess” / \texttt{lang-r.ess}, “Lang
  Python.mode” / \texttt{lang-python.mode}, “Lang Python.lsp” /
  \texttt{lang-python.lsp}; functions \texttt{h7python-lsp-switch},
  \texttt{h7python-use-eglot}, \texttt{h7python-use-lsp}
\item
  Status: conflicting
\item
  Evidence: \texttt{lsp-mode} hooks \texttt{python-mode} and
  \texttt{python-ts-mode} to call \texttt{lsp-deferred} unless
  \texttt{h7python-use-eglot} is non-nil. A separate
  \texttt{python-ts-mode-hook} checks whether the buffer filename
