    path or \texttt{\#\ \%\%} marker).
  \item
    Shuts down the other client if it is running
    (\texttt{lsp-disconnect} / \texttt{eglot-shutdown}).
  \item
    Starts exactly one client. Provide corrected \texttt{h7/} helpers
    (see ENH‑01). Also remove \texttt{lsp-deferred} from
    \texttt{python-mode-hook} / \texttt{python-ts-mode-hook} and let the
    buffer‑local function decide.
  \end{enumerate}
