  Key: \texttt{C-f} in \texttt{site-keys.el}: bound to
  \texttt{consult-line} at line 800 and again to \texttt{occur} at line
  802; retain \texttt{consult-line} and remove the later \texttt{occur}
  binding.
\item
  Key: \texttt{C-F4} in \texttt{site-keys.el}: bound to
  \texttt{vimish-fold-refold-all-from-marks},
  \texttt{edit-last-kbd-macro}, and \texttt{untabify-buffer} in
  different blocks; because Vimish Fold is removed, retain only
  \texttt{edit-last-kbd-macro} or rebind folding explicitly.
\item
  Key: \texttt{C-SPC} in \texttt{site-keys.el}: bound first to
  \texttt{completion-at-point} and then to \texttt{company-complete};
  retain \texttt{completion-at-point} for Corfu and remove the Company
  binding.
\item
  Key: \texttt{M-i} in \texttt{site-keys.el}: bound to
  \texttt{ido-goto-symbol}; remove it after Ido removal because the
  command becomes undefined.
\item
  Key: \texttt{remap\ find-tag} in \texttt{site-keys.el}: remapped to
  \texttt{ido-find-tag}; remove the remap after Ido removal.
\item
  Key: \texttt{C-.} in \texttt{site-keys.el}: bound to
